7,"Kanufi, Karshi in Nigeria people group profile | Joshua Project",https://joshuaproject.net/people_groups/12505/NI,"The Kanufi — also known as the Karshi, Anib, or Aninib — are an indigenous people of north-central Nigeria whose language, Kanufi, belongs to the Western Plateau subgroup of the Benue-Congo branch of Niger-Congo.",Kanufi,Niger-Congo
